{"tool_name":"btrackmate","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>TrackMate based tracker to be used when uploading integer labelled segmentation images, coming from a Deep Learning tool such as stardist. To use this tool efficiently we provide a python notebook to collect/localize the position of cells, this step creates a CSV file which can then be loaded into the Fiji tracker to do particle tracking with TrackMate interface.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>TrackMate based tracker to be used when uploading integer labelled segmentation images, coming from a Deep Learning tool such as stardist. To use this tool efficiently we provide a python notebook to collect/localize the position of cells, this step creates a CSV file which can then be loaded into the Fiji tracker to do particle tracking with TrackMate interface.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2021-01-28T13:50:51+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2021-01-28T13:46:05+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1611841851,"last_comment_uid":3642,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Varun Kapoor"}],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[],"has_function":[],"has_implementation":[],"has_interaction_level":[],"has_license":[],"has_location":[{"options":[],"title":"Update site Fiji MTrack","uri":"https://github.com/kapoorlab/BTrackMate"}],"has_programming_language":[],"has_reference_publication":[],"has_usage_example":[{"options":[],"title":"","uri":"https://twitter.com/EntraCod/status/1354786723016925184"}],"image":[{"alt":"","height":1258,"target_id":1284,"target_type":"file","target_uuid":"d77f2c44-e551-4cfb-9f2a-6feea5c567fa","title":"","url":"http://biii.eu/sites/default/f